    "PBKDF2 remains 600000; local real-workerd wall time is not provider CPU verification. Production email/provider/free-tier capacity, deployment configuration and independent security review remain gates.",
    "Only requested local public suite/types/read-only lint/ops rerun here; parent owns subsequent whole-matrix and fresh independent review. No private-chain/frontend implementation changed."
